name translations
category Package
revision 77682
shortdesc Internationalisation of LaTeX2e packages
relocated 1
longdesc This package (once part of the exsheets package), provides a
longdesc framework for providing multilingual features to a LaTeX
longdesc package. The package has its own basic dictionaries for
longdesc English, Brazilian, Catalan, Dutch, French, German and Spanish;
longdesc it aims to use translation material for English, Dutch, French,
longdesc German, Italian, Spanish, Catalan, Turkish, Croatian,
longdesc Hungarian, Danish and Portuguese from babel or polyglossia if
longdesc either is in use in the document. (Additional languages from
longdesc the multilingual packages may be possible: ask the author.)
